# Luxel library sprite — original art, Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# An original ginger tabby in a four-frame gallop, facing right: stretch,
# front paws plant, gather, hind push. The body rides a pixel higher on the
# two airborne frames and the tail swishes, so at 12 fps the run bounces.
# Made for Rainbow Runner, where keyframes carry it across the panel.
name: Cat Runner
fps: 12
